NNAAMMEE
     aaccppiibbaatt — ACPI control method battery

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     aaccppiibbaatt** aatt aaccppii??

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaccppiibbaatt driver supports the ACPI Control Method Battery interface be‐
     tween the battery and the host.  Information about the battery, such as
     capacity, recharge rate, voltage, and serial number, is available through
     this driver.  Battery status is updated through an event triggered when a
     battery changes state (such as starting to charge) and, as a failsafe if
     the system does not support passing such events, every 10 seconds.  Bat‐
     tery status can be monitored using sysctl(8) or sensorsd(8).

